  "title": "Homemade Ketchup",
  "description": "Chef John&#39;s homemade ketchup is easy to make in a slow cooker with crushed tomatoes and spices. It&#39;s tasty and thick and practically cooks itself.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
